Attached are the audited trial balance at June 30, 2026, the ledger detail yo=
u asked for and the equipment register with book and tax depreciation. Last y=
ear's return summary, the questionnaire, the tax payment log and the board re=
solution are in the shared folder. Please prepare the 2025 Form 1120 for our =
fiscal year ended June 30, 2026 for us to review. We filed Form 7004 on Septe=
mber 15 with a $15,000.00 payment.

A few things you will want to look at:

- We made no estimated payments during FY2026; the board expected last year's=
 loss to cover the year.
